{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Was erected, the Tabernacle.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: this teaches that another tabernacle was erected with it, and it is the Tabernacle of the Lad, whose name is Metatron, whose name is like the name of his Master. Thus far in the Midrash." "<b>And further.</b> In the Midrash of Behar Sinai Rabbah on the verse (Numbers 7:1): ״ויהי ביום כלות משה להקים את המשכן״. And further in the chapter אין דורשין: R. Shim'on said, at the time the Holy One, blessed be He, said to Israel to erect the Tabernacle, He hinted to the ministering angels that they too should make a tabernacle; and at the time it was erected below, it was erected above, and it is the Tabernacle of the Lad Metatron, in which he offers the souls of the righteous to atone for Israel in the days of their exile. And therefore it is written את המשכן — that another tabernacle was erected with it."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:08:00.683639931Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}